{"judge_label": "committed_silent", "justification_span": "MDRD equation:\nGFR = 175 × (Scr)^-1.154 × (age)^-0.203 × (0.742 if female) × (1.212 if African American)\n\nGiven:\n- Scr = 3.0\n- Age = 55\n- Male (no female factor)\n- African American (×1.212)\n\nStep 1: Scr^-1.154 = 3.0^-1.154\nln(3.0) = 1.0986\n× -1.154 = -1.2678\ne^-1.2678 = 0.2815\n\nStep 2: age^-0.203 = 55^-0.203\nln(55) = 4.0073\n× -0.203 = -0.8135\ne^-0.8135 = 0.4433\n\nStep 3: multiply\n175 × 0.2815 = 49.26\n49.26 × 0.4433 = 21.84\n× 1.212 = 26.47\n\nFINAL: 26.47"}